  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assessment of consumer trust and certification landscape in organic agriculture in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the assignment is to assess the current landscape of organic agriculture in Vietnam with a particular focus on consumer trust in organic products and the recognition and credibility of Vietnamese certification schemes, including the TCVN organic label. The assignment will provide insights into consumer perceptions, regulatory gaps, and market barriers, and deliver concrete recommendations to strengthen public awareness and confidence in organic products through improved certification communication and strategic outreach.</narrative>
  </description>
